(7045813, 1070771, 161988, '<td valign="top">I hope the rest of the group gets this picture. This is about as desolate as you can feel.  Alone, at the end of your life, confined to a chair and a building. Unable to turn back the hands of time.  This is truly a powerful photograph and you more than met the challenge.ee</td>', 'I hope the rest of the group gets this picture. This is about as desolate as you can feel.  Alone, at the end of your life, confined to a chair and a building. Unable to turn back the hands of time.  This is truly a powerful photograph and you more than met the challenge.ee', '2013-05-31 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
