(7045954, 1070559, 6519, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I can NOT see desolation here.<br/> <br/>The meaning of desolation is very negative.<br/> <br/>des·o·la·tion  <br/>/&amp;#716;des&amp;#601;&amp;#712;l&amp;#257;SH&amp;#601;n/<br/>Noun<br/>A state of complete emptiness or destruction.<br/>Anguished misery or loneliness.<br/>Synonyms<br/>devastation - havoc - ravage - destruction - solitude<br/> <br/>What you are showing here (although in a static, centered way) is peace, tranquillity and beauty.<br/> <br/>I guess it is all in the interpretation and I think I better just NOT vote.</td>', 'Sorry, but I can NOT see desolation here. The meaning of desolation is very negative. des·o·la·tion  /&#716;des&#601;&#712;l&#257;SH&#601;n/NounA state of complete emptiness or destruction.Anguished misery or loneliness.Synonymsdevastation - havoc - ravage - destruction - solitude What you are showing here (although in a static, centered way) is peace, tranquillity and beauty. I guess it is all in the interpretation and I think I better just NOT vote.', '2013-06-01 03:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
