(7046317, 1071224, 102315, '<td valign="top">I am assuming the title comes the man riding the horse in the pack towards the back. Very clever. The lighting is a bit harsh on most of the cellophane in the packs though. Maybe a different angle or removing the Cellophane may have made the image pop a little more.<br/> <br/>BTW that''s a lot of cigarette''s.</td>', 'I am assuming the title comes the man riding the horse in the pack towards the back. Very clever. The lighting is a bit harsh on most of the cellophane in the packs though. Maybe a different angle or removing the Cellophane may have made the image pop a little more. BTW that''s a lot of cigarette''s.', '2013-06-01 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
