(7048622, 1071261, 12611, '<td valign="top">Some great detail in here and the toning is nice. I like how you used the somewhat counter-intuitive light detailed background/dark sparse foreground to give a nice feeling of volume and space.</td>', 'Some great detail in here and the toning is nice. I like how you used the somewhat counter-intuitive light detailed background/dark sparse foreground to give a nice feeling of volume and space.', '2013-06-06 10:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
